        <mxCell id="8IH4HxK7WeanCxCvx9Mg-30" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Created by Terraform (29 resources):&lt;/b&gt; VPC, Internet Gateway, 6 subnets, 3 route tables + 6 associations, NAT Gateway + Elastic IP, S3 gateway endpoint, DB subnet group, 4 security groups, 2 EC2.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Security groups:&lt;/b&gt; alb-sg (80/443 from Internet) | bastion-sg (22 from admin IP /32) | app-sg (3000 from alb-sg, 22 from bastion-sg) | db-sg (5432 from app-sg only).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Routing:&lt;/b&gt; public = 0.0.0.0/0 to IGW | app = 0.0.0.0/0 to NAT (outbound only) | db = no internet route.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Faded icons&lt;/b&gt; = planned next phase (ALB, Auto Scaling Group, RDS Multi-AZ, S3 bucket, CloudWatch), not created yet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cost:&lt;/b&gt; about 0.08-0.10 USD/hour while running (NAT Gateway is the main item). Always run destroy.sh at the end of the session." vertex="1">
